---
import CTABand from '../ui/CTABand.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';

const lastUpdated = '2026-05-17';
---

<!-- Header -->
<section class="pt-20 pb-12 border-b border-[var(--color-border)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--color-accent)] mb-4">Now</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] leading-tight tracking-tight mb-5">
        What I'm doing right now.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
        A snapshot of what I'm building, exploring, and thinking about. Updated when something changes.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-[var(--color-text-dim)]"><span>Last updated:</span> {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-[var(--space-section)] border-b border-[var(--color-border)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 space-y-14">

      <!-- Building -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--color-accent)] mb-5">Building</p>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="border-l-2 border-[var(--color-accent)]/30 pl-5">
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-1">wojciech.io as a working operating system</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
              Turning the portfolio into a live proof-of-work: case studies for shipped apps, AI GTM tools that are documented in public, and insights that show how the systems actually work, not just that they exist.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-[var(--color-border-2)] pl-5">
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-1">GTM Agent Starter Pack</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
              Iterating on the Claude Code agent system for B2B outbound. Refining ICP scoring, extending the skills layer, and documenting the architecture for operators who want the system without the SaaS wrapper.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-2 border-[var(--color-border-2)] pl-5">
            <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-1">Case studies for Relora, Ads Assistant, Akademia AI</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
              Writing the full build-and-deploy stories for each product: the problem, the system design, the stack decisions, and what it proved.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Thinking about -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--color-accent)] mb-5">Thinking about</p>
        <div class="space-y-5 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            <span class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">AI won't fix weak GTM.</span><span> It will only make the chaos faster. Most B2B companies adding AI to their marketing don't have a capability problem. They have a clarity problem. Unclear ICP, weak positioning, undefined conversion logic. AI amplifies whatever's there, good or bad.</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            <span class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">Content is not a publishing calendar.</span><span> It's a compounding distribution and trust asset. The companies winning with content right now are the ones who treat it as infrastructure, not as a social media obligation.</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            <span class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">The best GTM work is boring to describe and obvious in results.</span><span> Nobody wants to hear about the CRM operating model you built. But it's the thing that's actually compounding.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Exploring -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--color-accent)] mb-5">Exploring</p>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          {[
            { label: 'MCP tooling for GTM workflows', note: 'Extending Claude Code agents with custom MCP servers for CRM, research, and content operations.' },
            { label: 'Audio-first learning formats', note: 'Testing completion and retention patterns on Akademia AI: what structure works when you remove the visual layer.' },
            { label: 'Personal brand as a distribution system', note: 'Building in public as a compounding acquisition channel, not for vanity metrics, but as a testbed for GTM hypotheses.' },
          ].map(({ label, note }) => (
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)]" aria-hidden="true" />
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-text)]">{label}</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">{note}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Not doing -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--color-accent)] mb-5">Not doing right now</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-text-dim)] shrink-0">-</span> <span>Pure branding or PR mandates without commercial architecture</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-text-dim)] shrink-0">-</span> <span>Pre-product companies without a defined ICP</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-[var(--color-text-dim)] shrink-0">-</span> <span>Strategy-only engagements that don't ship anything</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Follow -->
      <div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-5">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)] mb-1">Follow what I'm shipping</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">New articles and systems, when they're ready, not on a schedule.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/subscribe"
          class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-[var(--color-accent-text)] font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-[var(--radius-btn)] hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-hi)] transition-colors text-sm"
        >
          Subscribe
          <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M2 6h8M6 2l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Inspired by nownownow.com -->
  <section class="py-8 border-b border-[var(--color-border)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <p class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">
        This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-[var(--color-text)] transition-colors">/now page</a>: a snapshot of what I'm doing at this point in time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

<CTABand />
